-schoolappraisal-uploads/users/3dcc0dd157752392/attachments/0f1c9814-b53a-40ff-a84d-826f18823434-No._of_Functional_MoUs.pdf"}]}],"swocStrength":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"NEP 2020-aligned, interdisciplinary and Outcome-Based curriculum integrating AI, Business Analytics, FinTech, Digital Business, Power BI, Industry 4.0 and sustainability"},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Strong experiential learning ecosystem through internships, live projects, industrial visits, rural immersion, study tours, simulations, and Career Enhancement Programmes"},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Industry-oriented specializations supported by corporate collaborations, guest lectures, alumni mentoring, and professional networking platforms."},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Technology-enabled teaching-learning environment with digital resources, MOOCs, LMS, and professional certification support"},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Dedicated student development initiatives focusing on employability, leadership, innovation, ethics, and holistic development"}],"swocWeaknesses":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"Limited international collaborations, student/faculty exchange programmes, and global research partnerships."},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"BBA placement opportunities require further strengthening, particularly in niche and high-value sectors."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Need to enhance research commercialization through patents, consultancy, funded projects, and high-impact publications"},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Emerging AI and advanced analytics laboratory infrastructure requires further expansion and modernization."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Greater participation is required in globally recognized professional certifications and entrepreneurship activities."}],"swocOpportunities":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"Growing demand for professionals in AI, Business Analytics, FinTech, Digital Business, ESG, and Industry 5.0."},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Expand international collaborations through student exchange, faculty mobility, joint research, dual degrees, and global internships."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Strengthen consultancy services, executive education, funded research projects, innovation, incubation, and entrepreneurship ecosystem."},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Increase participation in global certifications, MOOCs, hackathons, business competitions, and research collaborations."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Pursue accreditations such as AACSB and global academic rankings to enhance institutional reputation."}],"swocChallenges":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"Rapid technological advancements require continuous curriculum revision and faculty upskilling."},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Intense competition from premier institutions offering specialized programmes with stronger global visibility and placement records."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Maintaining curriculum relevance amid evolving employer expectations and emerging business technologies."},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Attracting and retaining highly qualified faculty with interdisciplinary expertise and strong research credentials."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Ensuring sustainable growth while meeting increasing expectations of students, industry, regulatory bodies, and global education benchmarks."}],"swocOtherInformation":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"SoCM had published edited book on Green Horizons: Redefining Business and Sustainability Paradigms in the Technological Era in the May 2026"},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Publishes the School newsletter showcasing academic, research, and student achievements."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Organizes subject-specific poster competitions as an innovative continuous assessment practice."}]}	[{"name":"SoCM BOS SUMMARY_Updated (1).pdf","fileName":"SoCM BOS SUMMARY_Updated (1).pdf","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/dypiu-schoolappraisal-uploads/users/3dcc0dd157752392/attachments/b265ffe5-a905-4763-a465-c462a635c24f-SoCM_BOS_SUMMARY_Updated__1_.pdf"},{"name":"Academic Peer Feedback and ATR (1) - Copy (1).pdf","fileName":"Academic Peer Feedba