45	anupama.patil@dypiu.ac.in	academic	SOEMR	Dr Anupama Patil	2026-07-11 04:42:37.889149	APPROVED	Dear Sir / Madam,\n\nPlease go through the observations and recommendations provided by the Internal Auditor and prepare the compliance report to be presented before the External Auditor.\n\nYou are requested to include the compliance report for the observations shared in January 2026, along with the observations and recommendations from the latest Internal Audit Report. \nKindly ensure that the compliance report is complete and supported by the necessary documents/evidence, wherever applicable.	IQAC	2026-07-22 06:21:06.28416	{"schoolName":"School of Engineering, Management and Research (SEMR)","establishmentYear":"2024","address":"Sector 29, Nigdi Pradhikaran, Akurdi, Pune, Maharashtra 411044","directorName":"Dr. Mrs. Anupama V Patil","directorEmail":"anupama.patil@dypiu.ac.in","ugIntake":"360","pgIntake":"nil","academicCalendar":"Available","bosMeetingsCount":"08","stakeholderFeedback":"Feedback was collected from parents, students, faculty members, and academic peers regarding the curriculum and learning environment. Overall, stakeholders appreciated the relevance of the curriculum and teaching-learning process while recommending greater emphasis on industry-oriented content, practical and project-based learning, emerging technologies, internships, skill development, improved infrastructure, and stronger industry-academia interaction to enhance students' employability and holistic development.","feedbackAnalysis":"Feedback was collected from parents, students, faculty members, and academic peers regarding the curriculum and learning environment. Overall, stakeholders appreciated the relevance of the curriculum and teaching-learning process while recommending greater emphasis on industry-oriented content, practical and project-based learning, emerging technologies, internships, skill development, improved infrastructure, and stronger industry-academia interaction to enhance students' employability and holistic development.","actionTakenReport":"Based on the stakeholder feedback, the department strengthened industry-institute interaction through industrial visits, expert lectures, internships, and MoUs with industries. Project-based learning, mini-projects, and value-added certification courses were encouraged, while practical components, case studies, and emerging technologies were integrated into course delivery. The institute also upgraded laboratory facilities, library resources, and digital infrastructure to provide a better learning environment and support continuous curriculum improvement.","foreignCollaborations":"2","nationalCollaborations":"6","functionalMousCount":"12","__auditSignOff":{"submittedBy":{"name":"Dr Anupama Patil","designation":"Director","role":"director","date":"2026-07-11T04:42:37.663Z"},"approvedBy":{"name":"IQAC","designation":"IQAC","role":"iqac","date":"2026-07-22T06:21:06.707Z"},"auditedBy":{"name":"Mr Dinesh Kumar","designation":"Internal Academic Auditor","role":"academic-internal-auditor","date":"2026-07-22T06:16:22.037429452"}},"auditObservations":"1. Programme intake approval documents are not available.\\n2. Programme-wise enrollment records, including PRN-wise student lists, are incomplete.\\n3. Invitation letters and meeting links for Mechanical Engineering BoS meetings are missing.\\n4. ATR documents and syllabus circulation records are not available.\\n5. Comparative syllabus revision reports have not been provided.\\n6. Evidence of implementation of BoS recommendations is missing.\\n7. Syllabus formatting, sequencing and Reports formatting is not good as the style varies.\\n8. Duplicacy of course content in courses.","auditRecommendations":"1. Maintain complete records of BoS invitations and meeting links.\\n2. Upload ATR documents and email communications for syllabus circulation.\\n3. Prepare comparative reports highlighting syllabus revisions.\\n4. Maintain implementation records for all BoS recommendations.\\n5. Upload Registrar-approved intake documents for all programmes.\\n6. Maintain and upload complete programme-wise enrollment records, including PRN-wise admitted student lists.\\n7. Booklet formatting and CO-PO mapping along with the program booklet content must be in same sequence for all the courses.\\n8. Duplicacy of courses need to removed and the syllabus should be updated.","auditDocumentation":[{"name":"School of  Engineering Management and Research (SoEMR) Audit.xlsx","fileName":"School of  Engineering Management and Research (SoEMR) Audit.xlsx","url":"/uploads/users/e12664b2837d4446/attachments/4ad00bda-4bc8-4a9a-b657-54dfde43e8ea-School_of__Engineering_Management_and_Research__SoEMR__Audit.xlsx"}],"__reportArchive":{"category":"internal","auditCycle":"2025-26","version":1,"approvedOn":"2026-07-22T06:21:06.707Z"}}	{"studentStrength":[{"Sr No":"1","Class":"F.Y Mechanical Engineering","No. of Student":"118","Total":"118"},{"Sr No":"2","Class":"S.Y Mechanical Engineering","No. of Student":"106","Total":"106"},{"Sr No":"3","Class":"T.Y Mechanical Engineering","No. of Student":"24","Total":"24"},{"Sr No":"4","Class":"F.Y Semiconductor Engineering","No. of Student":"76","Total":"76"},{"Sr No":"5","Class":"S.Y Semiconductor Engineering","No. of Student":"71","Total":"71"},{"Sr No":"6","Class":"F.Y Chemical Engineering","No. of Student":"52","Total":"52"},{"Sr No":"7","Class":"S.Y Chemical Engineering","No. of Student":"21","Total":"21"},{"Sr No":"8","Class":"F.Y Civil Engineering","No. of Student":"81","Total":"81"},{"Sr No":"9","Class":"S.Y Civil Engineering","No. of Student":"103","Total":"103"}],"facultyStrength":[{"Sr No":"1","Required":"Mechanical Engineering -14","Available":"14"},{"Sr No":"2","Required":"Semiconductor Engineering-7","Available":"7"},{"Sr No":"3","Required":"Chemical Engineering-6","Available":"6"},{"Sr No":"4","Required":"Civil Engineering-7","Available":"7"}],"boardOfStudies":[{"Sr No":"1","Date of the meeting":"