sion and modernization."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Greater participation is required in globally recognized professional certifications and entrepreneurship activities."}],"swocOpportunities":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"Growing demand for professionals in AI, Business Analytics, FinTech, Digital Business, ESG, and Industry 5.0."},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Expand international collaborations through student exchange, faculty mobility, joint research, dual degrees, and global internships."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Strengthen consultancy services, executive education, funded research projects, innovation, incubation, and entrepreneurship ecosystem."},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Increase participation in global certifications, MOOCs, hackathons, business competitions, and research collaborations."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Pursue accreditations such as AACSB and global academic rankings to enhance institutional reputation."}],"swocChallenges":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"Rapid technological advancements require continuous curriculum revision and faculty upskilling."},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Intense competition from premier institutions offering specialized programmes with stronger global visibility and placement records."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Maintaining curriculum relevance amid evolving employer expectations and emerging business technologies."},{"Sr No":"4","Details":"Attracting and retaining highly qualified faculty with interdisciplinary expertise and strong research credentials."},{"Sr No":"5","Details":"Ensuring sustainable growth while meeting increasing expectations of students, industry, regulatory bodies, and global education benchmarks."}],"swocOtherInformation":[{"Sr No":"1","Details":"SoCM had published edited book on Green Horizons: Redefining Business and Sustainability Paradigms in the Technological Era in the May 2026"},{"Sr No":"2","Details":"Publishes the School newsletter showcasing academic, research, and student achievements."},{"Sr No":"3","Details":"Organi